Reject undersized records and truncated GPU payloads before retaining them.

Header progress check adapted from Punktfunk; payload validation added locally.
Source: https://git.unom.io/unom/punktfunk/src/commit/5bc6ade3afdd47f7013ecda99992d1e62c7e64ce/crates/pyrowave-sys/patches/0008-decoder-reject-zero-length-packet.patch
